hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"59","[AI-translation] Mere chehre ne use sajda kiya jis ne use paida kiya aur apni taqat wa quvvat se us ki samaat aur basarat kholi; behtareen Khaliq Allah babarkat hai. [Tilawat ke sajde mein kahe]"
"60","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Is ke badle mere liye apne pas ajr likh de, is ke badle mujhse bojh utar de, ise mere liye apne pas zakheera bana de aur mujhse ise qubul kar le jaise apne bande Dawud se qubul kiya. [Tilawat ke sajde mein kahe]"
